{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is seen, approach, grab and check it. Move to destination, do task. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInView    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
